WEBVTT

00:08:59.142 --> 00:09:01.593
to reach this goal.

00:09:01.593 --> 00:09:04.144
But the remaining question was, how?

00:09:04.144 --> 00:09:05.836
I mean, how is it possible?

00:09:05.836 --> 00:09:07.514
And here, what we found

00:09:07.514 --> 00:09:11.190
was completely unexpected.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:15.348
This novel training paradigm

00:09:15.348 --> 00:09:19.019
encouraged the brain to create new connections,

00:09:19.019 --> 00:09:21.921
some relay circuits

00:09:21.921 --> 00:09:24.969
that relay information from the brain

00:09:24.969 --> 00:09:28.125
past the injury and restore cortical control

00:09:28.125 --> 00:09:31.566
over the locomotor networks below the injury.